### Full authentication flow (registration/activation + login/PIN/session)
### Requires kopa.middleware-ktrn running on :8082 and Postgres reachable per application.yaml.
### PIN reset (forgot PIN) is deferred - needs kopa.notifications (not built yet).
@host = http://localhost:8083/kopa-customer-identity

### 1. Check MSISDN availability
GET {{host}}/api/v1/registration/msisdn-status/0798123456

### 2. Get 5 suggested MSISDNs
GET {{host}}/api/v1/registration/msisdn-suggestions

### 3. Search price plans for a new line
POST {{host}}/api/v1/registration/price-plans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "msisdn": "0798123456", "iccid": "8925012345678901234" }

### 4. KYC - verify a Rwandan citizen via NIDA
POST {{host}}/api/v1/registration/verify-nida/0798123456
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nationalId": "1194070023836062", "photoBase64": "/9j/4AAQSkZJRg==" }

### 5. Activate - subscribe-customer + simple-activate, issues a session
# @name activate
POST {{host}}/api/v1/registration/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "msisdn": "0798123456",
  "iccid": "8925012345678901234",
  "productCode": "PD00000574",
  "custType": "A",
  "fullName": "Test Subscriber",
  "birthDay": "19950101",
  "addressDetail": "Nyarutarama, Kigali",
  "email": "test.subscriber@example.com"
}

> {% client.global.set("session_token", response.body.token); %}

### 6. First-time PIN set-up (authenticated - uses the session from activation)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/pin/set
Authorization: Bearer {{session_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pin": "135790" }

### 7. Log in with MSISDN + PIN
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "msisdn": "0798123456", "pin": "135790" }

> {% client.global.set("session_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 8. Change PIN
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/pin/change
Authorization: Bearer {{session_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPin": "135790", "newPin": "246801" }

### 9. Logout
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{session_token}}

### 10. Invalid login -> expect 401
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "msisdn": "0798123456", "pin": "000000" }

### 11. Swagger UI / OpenAPI
GET {{host}}/swagger-ui.html
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs
